          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.23,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "And there you also learned a lot about features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 13.41,
          "en": "like React server components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 17.76,
          "en": "In this section, we'll now revisit those features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.76,
          "end": 20.779,
          "en": "and kind of summarize these core concepts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.779,
          "end": 23.64,
          "en": "which are actually part of React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.64,
          "end": 27.48,
          "en": "but which are not usable in all React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 30.51,
          "en": "Therefore, you can also take this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
