          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.04,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "but it's not a hard requirement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "Now, in this section here, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "we'll take a look at some key React features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 47.01,
          "en": "that are part of React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.01,
          "end": 50.31,
          "en": "but that are not usable in every React project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.31,
          "end": 53.4,
          "en": "And I'll explain why that's the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.4,
          "end": 56.01,
          "en": "And we'll specifically take a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.01,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "at React server components and client components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "what these are and how you use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "We'll explore the idea behind server actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "and compare them to form actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 70.14,
          "en": "about which you learned",
