          "end": 72.99,
          "en": "in a separate course section already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.99,
          "end": 77.34,
          "en": "And we'll revisit React's Suspense component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.34,
          "end": 79.95,
          "en": "and how it relates to the use hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.95,
          "end": 83.10300000000001,
          "en": "which is a hook that was added with React 19.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 86.61,
          "en": "It's a hook I already introduced",
